<title>ISRAEL: Koor raises stake in Tadiran.</title>
<headline>Koor raises stake in Tadiran.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Koor Industries Ltd, Israel's largest holding concern, has raised its stake in Tadiran Ltd in the past 10 days to 62.07 percent from 61.9 percent, a Koor spokesman said.</p>
<p>Koor purchased 44,916 shares for 2.7 million shekels during regular trading on the Tel Aviv bourse.</p>
<p>In recent months Koor has also increased its stakes in Agan Chemical Manufacturers, Makhteshim Chemical Works, Shemen Industries and Knafaim Arkia Holdings as part of its strategy of focusing more on certain core activities.</p>
<p>Both Koor and Tadiran are also listed on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>($1 = 3.14 shekels)</p>
<p>- Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
